  flagsOnComplete: []
  stepText:
  - Teach Pell's lantern the lane to Wendmire
  - Take the Wendmire warp off Tallow's approach
  - Follow Maru's beacons and relight the dark one
  - Come down dark through the tide-gate to Driftreed
  - Hold the pilots' line, then ask Ona Sedge about mats
  - Ask Maru Wend to take you into the mire
  - 'Follow Maru''s lamp across the mire: two short, one long'
  - Run the pumps that drain the hall and the lower gallery
  - Find Ona's apprentice in the lower gallery
  - Run the last pump, at the great hall's door
  - Kill the Rotbloom
  - Go back to Ona Sedge and hear what Driftreed decides
